    reg {
        name = "Receiver KSV (5 bytes)";
        desc = "Page 0 register 0x10 (host address base + 0x0 + 4 x 0x10). 8-bit register at a 32-bit stride.

Vendor U-Boot `product/hiosd/hdmi/hdmi_v1/hi3520d/` (`defstx.h`, `drv_hlviic.c`, `hdmitx.c`).";

